3. **Workflow for `ParkMapPending`**: Whenever a park comes back as `REVIEW`, check the `ParkMapPending` tab. You can fill in the canonical name in Column B right there, cut and paste those rows into `ParkMap`, and click **Volunteer Data > Run Cleaning Script** again to update everything.

