### How it handles your Maya Singh sample now:
- Even if a 10-digit row (`(415)555-1234`) and a 7-digit row (`555-1234`) occur in the same duplicate group, `mergePhoneField()` prioritizes the native 10-digit row (`phoneFilled === false`), outputs its row number in `PhoneSourceRow`, shows `(415)555-1234` in `RawPhone`, and **does not** add `FILLED-areaCode`.
- `FILLED-areaCode` will only appear when the winning row listed in `PhoneSourceRow` actually had a 7-digit number that used `Config!A1`.

