| 2, 3 | email | REVIEW | Maya Singh — same email, merged. Phone still 7-digit → `bad-phone`. |
| 4 | none | REVIEW | Tom Zhao — no email, no name match elsewhere. `bad-phone`, `no-email`. |
| 5 | none | REVIEW | A. Rivera — solo. `bad-phone`. |

If you added a second "A Rivera" row timestamped within 10 minutes of row 5, they'd cluster as `name-time` even with different (or missing) emails.

