## Changes from v3

| Change | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Phone formatting** | New `fmtPhone()` turns `5551234567` → `(555) 123-4567`. Applied at output time so internal logic still compares raw digits. Phone column is formatted as plain text (`@`) so Sheets doesn't mangle the parens. |
| **Timestamp tiebreaker** | Sort comparator now falls through to `a.srcRow - b.srcRow` when timestamps are equal, so the lower sheet row wins consistently regardless of `KEEP_FIRST` direction. |
| **Flags flipped** | `DRY_RUN = false`, `KEEP_FIRST = true` — ready to run as-is. |

